00:20:34.014 --> 00:20:38.500
when I look at it, it doesn't look bad at all when it's slightly oily like that.

196
00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:02.889
The meat has baked and shrunk, but never mind, it will still be enough,

197
00:21:02.889 --> 00:21:09.500
because I made it from a kilo, and the tray was almost full, and probably while it bakes,

