200
00:21:23.257 --> 00:21:25.000
like a little wrap.

201
00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:31.900
Something like that comes out, but I like it a lot. I'll show you when I put them on a plate.

202
00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:40.000
And all I have left is to make the tzatziki salad. Something along those lines, just so there's a choice.

203
00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:49.700
It's not that something is missing, it just looks so nice. And here I'll add, probably, some tomatoes.

204
00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:56.572
The salads are gradually set out here. Now I'll turn so you can see.

205
00:21:56.572 --> 00:22:00.700
This is what it will look like. A little tzatziki, coleslaw.

206
00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:08.400
Here I made onion with oil, a bit of vinegar and salt. Sliced fresh tomato. Here is pindjur.

207
00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:13.502
I wasn't particularly creative, because we're all

